<p>Surround yourself with a myriad of tiny, nearly invisible, reinforcing fungi.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">181, 234, 274, 307, 336</acronym> maximum life and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">8, 10, 12, 14, 15</acronym> life regeneration.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Willpower.</p>